{"version":1,"content":"<p>【21：16更新】今晨（26日）8時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指在元朗錦壆路近壆圍西路一貨倉被3隻狗追趕，並遭其中一隻狗咬傷小腿。</p><p>警方及救護員接報到場，傷者送往博愛醫院。</p><p>警方尋獲涉事狗主。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T14:12:13.319112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T13:18:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:20.492897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.521070+00:00","content_hash":"7c051c820e8d036e2e1a7f46af1d3a36074ab121234552347991324b87a38a28","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}